[00:26.50] When the dragons grow too mighty
[00:30.57] To slay with pen or sword
[00:35.74] I grow weary of the battle
[00:40.77] And the storm I walk toward
[00:46.26] When all around is madness
[00:51.11] And there's no safe port in view
[00:56.19] I long to turn my path homeward
[01:01.13] To stop a while with you
[01:07.62] When life becomes as barren
[01:13.77] And as cold as winter skies
[01:19.02] There's a beacon in the darkness
[01:24.03] In a distant pair of eyes
[01:29.64] In vain to search for honor
[01:34.23] And in vain to search for truth
[01:39.29] But these things can still be given
[01:44.29] Your love has shown me proof
[02:06.69] 